+
+## `PATCH /:account_slug/notifications/settings`
+
+Updates the current user's notification settings.
+
+Instead of one email per notification, notifications are bundled into time windows and delivered as a single email per window. The window opens when the first notification lands, and its length is set by `bundle_email_frequency`.
+
+__Parameters:__
+
+| Name | Type | Required | Description |
+|------|------|----------|-------------|
+| `settings[bundle_email_frequency]` | string | Yes | How often to email bundled notifications: `never`, `every_few_hours` (every 4 hours), `daily`, or `weekly` |
+
+__Response:__
+
+Returns `204 No Content` on success, or `422 Unprocessable Entity` for an unknown frequency.
